      "source": "Provides support for a <a href=\"AbstractLocaleResolver.html#setDefaultLocale(java.util.Locale)\">default\nlocale</a> and a <a href=\"#setDefaultTimeZone(java.util.TimeZone)\">default time zone</a>.",
